  "description": "Warning: No successful velero backup in 26h or never succeeded (schedule pvcs) \u2014 nightly 03:00 run missed or failing. NOTE: the absence arm of the original (absent() gauge before first success) is not expressible in O2 promql conditions \u2014 rely on the stream materializing after the first nightly run.",
  "enabled": true,
